297
00:38:30,200 --> 00:38:30,890
[SPEAKER_00] Čista namjera.

298
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:32,930
[SPEAKER_03] Pozicije. Al.

299
00:38:34,940 --> 00:38:35,870
