697
01:33:13,930 --> 01:33:16,000
[SPEAKER_00] Da bi bio najgori na utakmici daleko.

698
01:33:17,170 --> 01:33:17,470
[SPEAKER_03] Eto.

699
01:33:17,770 --> 01:33:25,750
